It seems I've covered the main part.

The change I made in `fastapi/datastructures.py` was:
```python
    @classmethod
    def __get_pydantic_json_schema__(
        cls, core_schema: Mapping[str, Any], handler: GetJsonSchemaHandler
    ) -> dict[str, Any]:
        return {"type": "string", "contentMediaType": "application/octet-stream"}
```

Let me verify the exact wording of the issue:
> Replace the use of `"format": "binary"` with `"contentMediaType": "application/octet-stream"` when generating JSON Schemas for bytes.

This is exactly what I did.

I'll do one last check of the `fastapi/datastructures.py` file to make sure I didn't miss any other `__get_pydantic_json_schema__` implementation that might be returning `binary` format.
